I narrate what I did: I scanned the codebase, searched for suspicious patterns (imports, DB creation at import time, SQL placeholders, column name mismatches, .kv references, hard-coded URLs), and inspected relevant files. Below are my findings and fixes.

Top-level notes before the list

I focused on functionality (what will break at runtime or cause wrong behaviour). I paid much less attention to security (as you requested), though I point out a couple of things where functionality and security overlap (e.g., running side-effects at import time).
